# Optional overrides (Create React App reads REACT_APP_* at build time).
# The chat works out of the box: the production Cloudflare Worker URL and the
# Turnstile sitekey are hardcoded defaults in src/Chat.js. Both are PUBLIC values
# (the sitekey is designed to be embedded in client HTML; the Worker is protected
# by Turnstile + a server-side key, not by obscurity), so no .env is required.
#
# Set these only to point at a different Worker or sitekey (e.g. staging, or
# Cloudflare's always-pass test sitekey 1x00000000000000000000AA for offline dev).

# REACT_APP_CHAT_API_URL=https://ashish-portfolio-chatbot-edge.bordeashish.workers.dev/
# REACT_APP_TURNSTILE_SITEKEY=0x4AAAAAAD56IKsZD9ZC6BV2
